  "reflectionText": "Moses went up to the top of Pisgah, saw the whole land, and died there in Moab. The Lord buried him in the valley, and no man knows of his tomb to this day. What is the quiet of being shown the whole inheritance and being asked to die before you can walk across the open ground?"
